  "answer": "A",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$I = \\frac{E}{R + r} = \\frac{10}{4 + 1} = 2\\ \\text{A}$$\n\n$$V = E - Ir = 10 - 2 \\times 1 = 8\\ \\text{V}$$",
